{"id":"95213b573c0bce18","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness.md","title":"Soundness and Completeness of the Specified Calculus","display":"lem-classical-calculus-correctness — Soundness and Completeness of the Specified Calculus","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness","aliases":["88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness"],"display":"lem-classical-calculus-correctness — Soundness and Completeness of the Specified Calculus","depends_on":["[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-logical-consequence]]","[[88-df-soundness]]","[[88-df-completeness]]","[[88-df-canonical-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-classical-calculus-correctness — Soundness and Completeness of the Specified Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b906e83ff9b25155\" href=\"?note=b906e83ff9b25155\" title=\"88-df-logical-consequence\">88-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b832ab071fc28945\" href=\"?note=b832ab071fc28945\" title=\"88-df-soundness\">88-df-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3d408f890c399f45\" href=\"?note=3d408f890c399f45\" title=\"88-df-completeness\">88-df-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"19f597e8b5469bbc\" href=\"?note=19f597e8b5469bbc\" title=\"88-df-canonical-model\">88-df-canonical-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\">\\(R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_R\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_R\\varphi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models_S\\varphi\">\\(T\\models_S\\varphi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b906e83ff9b25155\" href=\"?note=b906e83ff9b25155\" title=\"88-df-logical-consequence\">88-df-logical-consequence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_R(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b832ab071fc28945\" href=\"?note=b832ab071fc28945\" title=\"88-df-soundness\">88-df-soundness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3d408f890c399f45\" href=\"?note=3d408f890c399f45\" title=\"88-df-completeness\">88-df-completeness</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall S,T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\to\\mathrm{Sound}_{R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Complete}_{R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S}(T)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall S,T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\to\\mathrm{Sound}_{R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Complete}_{R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S}(T)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall S,T,R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\to\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall S,T,R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\to\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可靠性按推导长度归纳。公理模式在每个结构和赋值下有效；分离规则保持真；前提都是句子，因此概括步骤在所有赋值下保持真。</p>\n<p>完备性使用所列公理模式的演绎定理。若句子不可证，添加其否定保持一致；逐步加入新常量作存在见证，并扩张到最大一致 Henkin 理论。等号的反身性及替换公理使闭项上的可证相等成为函数、关系的同余；闭项商结构满足真值引理，给出反模型。任意签名可先良序其公式并作相应的超限扩张。这里的性质针对已明确给出的演算，不是把“完备”重新命名成假设。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\subseteq R\">\\(R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\subseteq R\\)</span>，原演算的每条有限推导仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 推导，所以第二个断言由第一个得到；不需要额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 可靠。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-classical-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"0aa80b611d62ec1b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"b906e83ff9b25155","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"b832ab071fc28945","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-soundness]]",